Server init.

>> x := Blob haaraa: 65 gosa: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Sagantaa qindaaʼina: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server walqabsiisi: (
 Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x irraa: 0 dheerina: 1), dhaabi.
x gadi-lakkisi.

